# Socratic Dialogue Health Query
# 检测苏格拉底对话健康状态

```dataview
TABLE project, intent, dialogue_turn_count, layer, dialogue_health, status, last_updated
FROM "5_学术研究织网/对话日志"
WHERE type = "socratic-dialogue"
SORT last_updated DESC
```

## 健康警告

```dataview
TABLE project, intent, dialogue_turn_count, layer, health_alerts, last_updated
FROM "5_学术研究织网/对话日志"
WHERE type = "socratic-dialogue"
WHERE dialogue_health = "critical" OR dialogue_health = "warning"
SORT last_updated DESC
```

## 活跃对话

```dataview
TABLE project, intent, layer, layer_name, dialogue_turn_count, status
FROM "5_学术研究织网/对话日志"
WHERE type = "socratic-dialogue"
WHERE status = "in-progress"
SORT last_updated DESC
```

## 意图分布

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  intent AS "User Intent",
  length(rows) AS "Dialogue Count"
FROM "5_学术研究织网/对话日志"
WHERE type = "socratic-dialogue"
GROUP BY intent
```

## 层进度

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  layer_name AS "Layer",
  length(rows) AS "Dialogues at Layer"
FROM "5_学术研究织网/对话日志"
WHERE type = "socratic-dialogue"
GROUP BY layer_name
```